## AI Model License Notice

This application is designed to work with open-weight language models loaded
through LM Studio or compatible local runtimes.

Open-weight models are NOT necessarily open-source software. Each model has
its own license terms, which may restrict commercial use, redistribution,
or modification. This application does not bundle, distribute, or download
any model.

Before loading a model, review its license. Common model licenses include:
- Llama Community License (Meta)
- Apache 2.0
- MIT
- Gemma Terms of Use (Google)
- Mistral Research License

This application's MIT license applies only to the application source code,
not to any model weights you choose to load.
